      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would be good to have a consistent naming scheme (with -tiramisu or without; I\u0027d say without now, and loprio vs low-priority). But the difference between loprio.txt and max-target-o-low-priority-tiramisu.txt is preexisting.\n\nIs there anything to watch out for if we rename these files ?",
      "revId": "c8164e49636367f4442f70c60856ac881acbb156",
